/-! Base restriction and tensor data for localized projection sites.

Source: Stacks Project, Modules on Sites, Tag 04J0; Cohomology on Sites,
Tags 08FI, 0FN5 and 07A4.
(blueprint: lem-weil-pbc-ringed-projection-local-base-data).
